{
  "id": "path-reject-third-active-goal",
  "prompt": "再帮我建一个 8 周算法路径",
  "tags": ["path", "safety"],
  "setup": {
    "goals/active.md": "# Active goals\n\n1. **office-weekly** — 周报系统\n2. **python-basics** — Python 基础\n"
